  "body": "This issue relates to issue #46.\n\nTo the degree that it makes sense to state document-conformance requirements for values provided in scripts (as opposed to provided in HTML markup), we should consider making BCP-47-validity for `lang` values a document-conformance requiring (aka authoring requirement) rather than a requirement that we place on UAs.\n",
